Package: com.gokuencinar.carrierfix.dopamine
Name: CarrierFix (Dopamine)
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Experimental Cricket/AT&T carrier overlay diagnostic and SMS/IMS repair tool for jailbroken iOS 15-18. Creates and verifies a per-carrier backup before modifying the active overlay and supports one-tap restore.
Maintainer: Gokuencinar
Author: Gokuencinar
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), firmware (<< 19.0)
Conflicts: com.gokuencinar.carrierfix, com.gokuencinar.carrierfix.rootful